  <prompt>Confirm the "+" create still applies the regarding resolver and field mapping identically to the current inline path, now that the wizard runs in a code page reached via navigateTo. The wizard services already do this; verify the launch-context wiring feeds them correctly.</prompt>
  <role>QA engineer with Dataverse regarding/field-mapping knowledge</role>
  <goal>Created Event/Invoice/Report Card records (via a navigateTo-launched page with the host envelope) have correct sprk_regarding* fields + mapped fields — parity with the standalone-page create.</goal>
